// Base mainnet (chain id 8453) — Basenames. Base is a manifest-only network
// (no code defaults). The Basenames contracts map onto the V1-shaped fields:
// registry/base_registrar/controller/resolver/reverse; the second (upgradeable)
// controller 0xa7d2607c6bd39ae9521e514026cbb078405ab322 is discovered at index
// time via the registrar's ControllerAdded events. V2 fields stay disabled —
// ENS V2 is not deployed on Base. Deploy blocks from on-chain first-event data.
